                <VideoIcon className="w-16 h-16 text-brand-primary mx-auto mb-6" />
                <h1 className="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 text-content-primary">Activation Required</h1>
                <p className="text-content-secondary mb-8">
                    To access the high-performance Gemini 3 and Veo Video engines, you must select an API key from a paid Google Cloud project.
                    <br/><br/>
                    <a href="https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/docs/billing" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" className="text-brand-primary hover:underline">View Billing Details</a>
                </p>
                <button onClick={handleSelectKey} className="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-primary to-brand-secondary text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl text-lg hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] transition-all duration-200">
                    Select API Key to Begin
